        },
        "template--15035832991823__32d6329c-c3f7-4569-8ad3-ff8b742afe51-text-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What Are Lab-Grown Diamonds?",
            "pre-title": "",
            "heading_size": "small",
            "text": "<p>Lab grown diamonds, also known as synthetic, grown diamonds, or lab created diamonds, are diamonds, but they are grown in a controlled laboratory environment using advanced technology to replicate the earth's natural process of crystallizing carbon into brilliant diamonds.</p><p>Lab created diamonds possess the same chemical and physical properties as natural diamonds, making them chemically, optically, and physically identical to earth-mined diamonds. They not only offer a sustainable and ethical alternative to mined diamonds, they also come at a more affordable price point without compromising on quality. So, if you're looking for a stunning and eco-friendly choice, consider the brilliance of a lab-grown diamond.</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://www.miadonna.com/collections/lab-created-diamonds\" title=\"https://www.miadonna.com/collections/lab-created-diamonds\">Shop loose diamonds</a></p><p><a href=\"#\" title=\"#\">How to choose the best lab grown diamonds</a></p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "link": "",
            "button_style": "button--primary",
            "background": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "text_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "alignment": "left",
            "vertical_position": "center"
          }
        }
